    },
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "This page tracks one-time CI/CD and @@@hl@@@environment@@@endhl@@@ infrastructure setup tasks — distinct from 7.1a Tool Access Tracker!--https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/259686402...Accenture DevOps\nSettings → @@@hl@@@Environments@@@endhl@@@ → New @@@hl@@@environment@@@endhl@@@: sit",
      "format": "view"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "318472193",
    "title": "Contentful CMS — Setup & Operations",
