      "value": "Architecture: Single Contentful space with one @@@hl@@@environment@@@endhl@@@ per delivery tier.\n@@@hl@@@Environment@@@endhl@@@ IDs match SFCC tier names exactly — no mapping required at runtime...@@@hl@@@Environment@@@endhl@@@ Topology\nSix-tier delivery pipeline. Contentful @@@hl@@@environment@@@endhl@@@ IDs map directly to MRT push targets",
      "format": "view"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "305102849",
    "title": "Human-in-the-Lead AI Development — Project Setup Overview",
